{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XIsBxxofiU1795567615.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>酒泉衛星發射中心宣布，神舟二十四號發射任務取得圓滿成功。</p><p></p><p>【此前報道】</p><p></p><p>神舟二十四號載人飛船，上午8時18分發射升空，是中國航天史上，首次中外航天員聯合飛行。</p><p></p><p>搭載神舟二十四號飛船的長征二號F遙二十四運載火箭，在酒泉衛星發射中心升空。執行任務的包括指令長湯洪波，航天飛行工程師武毅，以及巴基斯坦載荷專家穆罕默德．齊尚．阿里。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LAUNCH-0830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OAbI45g9lS1795567623.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>飛船入軌後，會優先採用自主快速交會對接，約3.5小時後，與中國太空站天和核心艙對接，形成三船三艙組合體。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LAUNCH-0830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260H7FxPo2yF1795567647.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>根據慣例，神二十四會與神二十三航天員在太空站共同生活約一星期，完成交接後，齊尚．阿里會與神二十三兩名航天員返回地球。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:54.958486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T23:30:37.063922+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T01:17:18.008806+00:00","content_hash":"8564733c1d42f22b5f000ad39e555561e983407d7dcdf173fada407f60138c78","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:54.958486+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}